# S-045 send thread: graceful stop. The loop sends headers before the first packet, packets in queue order, and
# stops at the first packet whose system dts is at/after the stop time (that packet is released unsent).
# stop(ts_ns) => cutoff = ts/1000 microseconds. Fake muxer sizes: every write is 10 bytes.
reset
aenc 0 aac 160
venc 0 h264 2500
service rtmp://h/a KEY - -
init_connect
set active 1
pkt audio 100000 0 0
pkt video 200000 3 1
pkt video 300000 2 0
pkt audio 400000 0 0
pkt video 500000 2 0
stop 450000000
# one more packet whose time is past the cutoff terminates the drain
run_send
queue
released
